      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Schnecksville sits on a 660‑foot ridge, with Jordan Creek to the west and Coplay Creek to the east draining into the Lehigh River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18,
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
