      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Pennsylvania Route 309 cuts through the heart of Schnecksville, linking the community south to Interstate 78 and north to Allentown.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Schnecksville%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The 29‑acre Lehigh Valley Zoo, open year‑round, occupies the southwest edge of Schnecksville beside the Trexler Nature Preserve.",
